thout a nightly spreadsheet.</p></div></div><div class="border-border bg-card flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5"><span class="bg-foreground text-brand-500 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plug h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22v-5"></path><path d="M15 8V2"></path><path d="M17 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z"></path><path d="M9 8V2"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Tally / CA hand-off</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm">Export sales and purchase data in a format your accountant can take straight into the books.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-muted/40"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 15% 0%, rgb(248 208 0 / 0.14), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Client results</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Businesses already running this way.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Published results from Extraaaz clients. Your outcomes depend on your workflows and rollout.</p></div><div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-2xl"><article class="relative flex flex-col gap-5 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex